🎯 New Rule From This Topic Onward

From now on, I want you to answer every constraint question by first asking yourself:

Can this value ever be empty? → NOT NULL
Must this value be unique? → UNIQUE
Does this identify the row? → PRIMARY KEY
Should it have a starting value? → DEFAULT
Does it have a valid range? → CHECK
Does it belong to another table? → FOREIGN KEY

If you build this habit now, designing database schemas later will feel almost automatic.
